<div class="folder"><div class="wrap"><div class="flabel" style="border-left-color:var(--ox2)"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Claims desk</li></ol><p class="lbl">Claims desk</p><h1>What to do after a loss, hour by hour</h1><p class="lede" style="margin:0">Pick what happened. Each guide splits the next steps into the first hour, the first day and the first week. Claims line (fictional): <b class="mono">(555) 014-2200</b>.</p></div></div></div>
<section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap">{% for c in Target.Items %}{%- assign x=c.PublishedContent -%}<article style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:330px 1fr;gap:30px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)"><div><span class="code">Guide {{ forloop.index }} · {{ x.code }}</span><h2 style="font-size:1.55rem;margin:6px 0 8px"><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></h2><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 14px">{{ x.summary }}</p><a class="btn sm line" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">Full guide</a></div><div class="hours3 paper" style="margin-top:0"><div class="hcol h1st"><h4>First hour</h4><ol>{%- assign st = x.first_hour | split: "|" -%}{% for s in st limit:3 %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div><div class="hcol h2nd"><h4>First day</h4><ol>{%- assign st = x.first_day | split: "|" -%}{% for s in st limit:3 %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div><div class="hcol h3rd"><h4>First week</h4><ol>{%- assign st = x.first_week | split: "|" -%}{% for s in st limit:3 %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
